---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { getMeta } from '../utils/data';
const meta = getMeta();
---

<Base title="Methodology" description="How ref-ball attributes shooting fouls to individual officials.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1 class="display">Attribution methodology</h1>
      <p class="lead">Shooting-foul calls are attributed by parsing the referee name from the unstructured <code>description</code> field in NBA play-by-play data.</p>
      <h2>Layer 1 — published</h2>
      <p>Per-official shooting-foul rates and player×official interaction profiles. Player-pair ANOVA across officials: p = 0.000003.</p>
      <h2>Defense adjustment</h2>
      <p>Raw FTA deltas confound opponent defensive quality. Defense-adjusted FTA/36 deltas control for opponent DefRtg in games with vs without each official.</p>
      <h2>Layer 2 &amp; 3 — research frontier</h2>
      <p>Contact-type classification and no-call detection are in progress. They appear in prose on companion pages, not as browseable data here.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
